      "summary": "A flashback, never explained, just played: the junior year Maya lost. Axel fronts, comes out as a trans man as the body, and dates Mark, a kind, queer Episcopalian classmate, who never learns about the system. Tanya keeps inviting and checking in, and Axel ignores all of it. It ends when Maya comes back. The first time, this chapter is always played as Axel.",
